      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        104.793701171875,
        465.7410888671875,
        143.51361083984375
      ],
      "text": "They can give you advice about that and also about how to avoid the\npossibility of your mum having a fall.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        156.45205688476562,
        128.062255859375,
        175.95346069335938
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        176.43470764160156,
        529.3423461914062,
        195.23361206054688
      ],
      "text": "Great. So once they've done this assessment, if I'm eligible, what happens next?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        208.0520477294922,
        105.86299896240234,
        227.55343627929688
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        228.1547088623047,
        474.5357971191406,
        286.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "Well, they might support you financially. So they might help you with\ntransport costs, like if you have to get a taxi to take your mother for an\nappointment, for example.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        299.6110534667969,
        128.062255859375,
        319.1124572753906
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        319.59368896484375,
        432.0220642089844,
        338.3926086425781
      ],
      "text": "I usually drive her myself, actually. So, could I claim the petrol?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        351.33203125,
        105.86299896240234,
        370.83343505859375
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        371.4346923828125,
        367.8589782714844,
        390.2336120605469
      ],
      "text": "You could. And you can claim for the insurance too.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        403.0520324707031,
        128.062255859375,
        422.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        423.0346984863281,
        128.69924926757812,
        441.8336181640625
      ],
      "text": "Oh, right.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        454.7710266113281,
        105.86299896240234,
        474.2724304199219
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        474.87469482421875,
        522.7755126953125,
        553.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "And if you need help with the housework, they can arrange for someone to\ncome along once or twice a week. And one other thing. I hope you don’t mind\nme saying this, but it important you look after yourself. And it seems to me you\nunder quite a bit of stress.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        566.1320190429688,
        128.062255859375,
        585.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        586.2347412109375,
        125.21894836425781,
        605.0336303710938
      ],
      "text": "I am yes.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        617.85205078125,
        105.86299896240234,
        637.3534545898438
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        637.834716796875,
        496.1351013183594,
        676.5526123046875
      ],
      "text": "Well tell the council because they may be able to give you some advice on\nhow to minimise it.\n"
